OL,3,AMen admit trying to tunnel into
OL,4,Ajewellery shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men who were caught trying to
OL,7,Ftunnel into a jewellery shop from a
OL,8,Fneighbouring massage parlour have
OL,9,Fadmitted conspiracy to commit burglary.
OL,11,FIoan Asafeti, 39, Laurentiu-Daniel
OL,12,FNitisoara, 38, both of no fixed
OL,13,Faddress, and Sergiu Plastin, 42, of
OL,14,FPortadown, County Armagh, were behind
OL,15,Fthe attempted raid on Mitcham Road in
OL,16,FTooting, south London, in the early
OL,17,Fhours of 17 July.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
