OL,3,AMen admit trying to tunnel into
OL,4,Ajewellery shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FKingston Crown Court heard how
OL,7,Fbody-worn camera footage captured
OL,8,FNitisoara being arrested in a nearby
OL,9,Falleyway, while Asafeti was found
OL,10,Fhiding on a rooftop.
OL,12,FPlastin was tracked down using mobile
OL,13,Fphone data and arrested later that day
OL,14,Fat Stansted Airport as he tried to
OL,15,Fboard a flight to Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
